WEBVTT

00:00:58.158 --> 00:01:02.221
And you almost go
to, like, a place of shame.

00:01:05.223 --> 00:01:06.522
Adam Grant: I'm Adam Grant,

00:01:06.546 --> 00:01:08.808
and this is a special
bonus episode of WorkLife,

00:01:08.832 --> 00:01:09.991
my podcast with TED,

00:01:10.015 --> 00:01:13.298
